ecognized_model` is expected and benign. Never convert a review command into an editing\n191:# Claude Code family (claude, glm, deepseek, muse) — CLAUDE_BIN picks the wrapper, MODEL=<model> the model\n192:CLAUDE_BIN=\"claude\"   # or: MODEL=<model> glm | MODEL=<model> deepseek | MODEL=<model> muse\n231:- **GLM/Muse `claude-code:unrecognized_model` startup warnings** are expected\n\nTesting yin.vm.ucf.authority-test\n\nTesting yin.vm.ucf.checkpoint-test\n\nTesting yin.vm.ucf.compose-rows-test\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
